; Registers the shared C++L TextMate grammar (editors/shared/cppl.tmLanguage.json,
; copied into the VSIX's Grammars folder at build time) with Visual Studio's
; TextMate colorizer. The grammar's `fileTypes` associates it with `.cppl`.
[$RootKey$\TextMate\Repositories]
"cppl"="$PackageFolder$\Grammars"
